{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28544","headline":"见穆三十宅中庭海榴花谢 · 杜牧","name":"见穆三十宅中庭海榴花谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"矜红掩素似多才，不待樱桃不逐梅。\n春到未曾逢宴赏，雨余争解免低徊。\n巧穷南国千般艳，趁得春风二月开。\n堪恨王孙浪游去，落英狼籍始归来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28544.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28544","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}